# VoxGuard Core

You are working in **VoxGuard / EchoGuard AI** (AMVTF v2.4) — a voice deepfake + identity + scam-language SOC platform.

## Stack truth

- Backend: `backend/` FastAPI on port 8000
- Frontend: `echoguard/` Next.js 16 on port 3000
- DB: SQLite (`backend/voxguard.db`) or Postgres when `DATABASE_URL` is set

## Engines (code reality)

- `engines/aasist.py` — authenticity / anti-spoof (heuristics + optional sklearn joblib)
- `engines/ecapa.py` — 192-dim speaker embedding + cosine match (not a full pretrained ECAPA net unless weights are present)
- `engines/nlp.py` — ASR (SpeechRecognition) + scam keyword dictionary
- `engines/amvtf.py` — fuses signals → SAFE / WARNING / CRITICAL
- `engines/spectrogram.py` — STFT PNG evidence

Do not oversell marketing labels (GNN / DistilBERT) beyond what the code implements.

